  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWinForms and LibreWPF 0.1.0-preview.28 with immutable ProGPU 0.1.0-preview.27; builds unchanged .NET WinForms template projects through LibreWinForms.Sdk without requiring a Windows TFM; generates the standard ApplicationConfiguration entry point and WinForms global imports; preserves hosted double-click counts for Project Explorer and designer interactions; gives MenuStrip, ToolStrip, and context dropdowns correctly positioned and interactive native popup surfaces; and retains typed designer, keyboard, layout, bounded-memory, and glyph-scrolling behavior.",
